# Base URL of the legacy permalink bucket's data/ prefix (trailing slash).
# Defaults in code to https://csvjson.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/data/ —
# the production bucket the CSP already whitelists. Read-only: the SPA
# only ever GETs from this URL.
VITE_S3_DATA_URL=https://csvjson.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/data/
